Subject: Re: [stan-users] Rstudio & .stan files: prevent soft-wrap?
Message-ID: <YUYLGEisrQA.SZcpdLl_AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <YUYLGEisrQA.W0C_3WR5AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <YUYLGEisrQA.W0C_3WR5AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
