>
> I fear I am lacking the skills to hunt down memory leaks (if there are any!).
>
> I know to little about the initialization/warmup processes of stan, but I assume that it must be something that happens in these processes that leads to increased memory usage, because memory usage is orders of magnitude smaller when I use "good"* initialization values.
