I have decided to add a constrain and it seem to be running now. Here
is  what I did

hl[j,i]<- h0[i]*D[j,i]*exp(gama[1]*b[id[j],1]+
gama[2]*b[id[j],2]+gama[3]*b[id[j],3]);
 if (hl[j,i]>0)
  increment_log_prob(poisson_log(dN[j,i], hl[j,i]));

Hope it makes sense.

