Great! so since normal_log is symmetric in its first two arguments, either way I code it

exp((x[i]-a)/b) ~ normal(y[i],ysigma);

or

y[i] ~ normal(exp(x[i]-a)/b);

or

exp((x[i]-a)/b)-y[i] ~ normal(0,ysigma);

all gives the same result!

