Subject: Forcing a coefficient to be zero conditionally
Message-ID: <CmG2s0xOTh8.Z7viLvD0AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/CmG2s0xOTh8/m/Z7viLvD0AwAJ>
