It looks like you hit the pre-reqs,

https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/wiki/RStan-Getting-Started#prerequisites

because it's trying to use clang.   I'm going to have to
defer to those who know more about R.  It just worked for me
on Mac on Yosemite.

I'm assuming T and TRUE give you the same thing?   And you restarted
R, so I don't see anything you didn't do.

- Bob

