You cannot have discrete parameters in your model as Stan uses HMC, which requires a continuous parameter space. For some models that do have discrete parameters, you can marginalize over the possible values for the discrete parameter, provided that they constitute a limited set (or can be assumed to be). See Stan manual chapter on mixture models. Manual in general is a good place to start reading up on HMC.

