I think there are multiple issues here. The first one --- which apparently multiple people are facing --- is that RStudio for Windows is not receiving stdout when chains are executed in parallel. Any help as to why that is would be appreciated. It should be possible to see the real error(s) by specifying chains = 1 or open_progress = TRUE (in which case Internet Explorer will open the progress file that can be refreshed).

The second error is whatever is causing the chain(s) to stop, which could be one of any number of things depending on the model.

Ben

