Ben,

The problem here seems to be that mc.cores is set to be larger than 1, so setting chains=1 is not enough to disable creating multiple processes.

It looks like we need to change this line of code (from chains > 0 to chains > 1):
https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/blob/develop/rstan/rstan/R/stanmodel-class.R#L368

Jiqiang

