Hi Eric,

You're looking at a summary of the posterior distribution with the print() function.

For each iteration, z[15] is exactly
0 or 1. You're looking at summary of many iterations.

This is an important concept... I'm not sure where to point you for a clear explanation, but hopeful someone can suggest something.

Daniel

