I've been trying to stay out of commenting on things I don't
understand well.  I don't understand the MATLAB notation well
enough to understand if you coded it correctly in Stan.  But it
looks like you may have missed an exp(), which would make adding
the machine precision meaningless (and just pull the parameter
away from being a simplex).

The best thing to do is run tests to make sure you're getting
what you think you're getting.  Then fit with simulated data to
make sure the model's right.

- Bob

